fr-vectors.bin: French word vectors

This file is adapted from the "French Word Embeddings" of Jean-Philippe Fauconnier
(http://fauconnier.github.io), the model frWac_non_lem_no_postag_no_phrase_200_skip_cut100,
trained on the frWaC corpus. It is shared under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 licence
(CC BY 3.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/).

Changes: the vocabulary is cut to 50 000 words (plus the words of the game), the vectors are
normalised and quantised to bytes. tools/vectors/build.py makes the file from the original.

